🍬 Some limited time halloween items are in the store! Offsale after october

🌆 A fast multiplayer obby racing game with parkour movement like vaulting, sliding, wall running, ziplining and more
💎 Earn & buy wearable cosmetics such as gloves, boots & crowns

💖 Personal passion project of mine. I hope you have fun!
🎵 All ingame music is original

